                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f04f21f3-1941-3c85-bc2d-d981122279fb",
                        "entry_id": "b3d396e7-6cfc-3254-ab79-73c9c36d7e6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to enslave, to put into bonded labour"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fba8cfc5-10ab-4ec5-8537-9f145cc873a7",
                                "sense_id": "f04f21f3-1941-3c85-bc2d-d981122279fb",
                                "text": "Постоя́нные долги́, благодаря́ приёмам управле́ния, росли́ и затя́гивали крестья́н: кредито́р вла́ствовал над должнико́м и закабаля́л его рабо́той на себя́, рабо́той за неплатёж из го́да в год накопля́вшейся неусто́йки.",
                                "translation": "Thanks to management tricks, the ever-present debts grew and sucked down the peasants; the creditor lorded over the debtor and bonded him into labor, labor as compensation for the unpaid late fees accumulating year after year.",
                                "english": "Thanks to management tricks, the ever-present debts grew and sucked down the peasants; the creditor lorded over the debtor and bonded him into labor, labor as compensation for the unpaid late fees accumulating year after year."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
